  "historyNote": "#4073, eff 6-26-86, EXPIRED: 6-26-92 New. #5630, eff 5-26-93; amd by #6240, HB 32, eff 5-3-96, EXPIRED 12-31-98; ss by #7006, INTERIM, eff 5-26-99, EXPIRED: 9-23-99 New. #9466, eff 5-2-09; ss by #12167, INTERIM, eff 4-29-17, EXPIRED: 10-26-17 New. #12640, eff 10-3-18",
